"a string as a plottable symbol. A text symbol can be drawn by passing l\\ "
"size\\ +t\\ string to the style parameter where size defines the size of the "
"text symbol (note: the size is only approximate; no individual scaling is "
"done for different characters) and string can be a letter or a text string "
"(less than 256 characters). Optionally, you can append +f\\ font,"
"outlinecolor to select a particular font [Default is FONT_ANNOT_PRIMARY] and "
"outline color [Default is black] as well as +j\\ justify to change the "
"justification [Default is CM]. For all supported fonts see /techref/fonts. "
"The fill color of the text symbols can be set with the fill parameter, and "
"the outline width can be customized with the pen parameter.\">"
